{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"SosomLab.NexaDir","latestVersion":"0.29.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Lightweight dual-panel file explorer that looks identical on Windows, macOS and Linux","license":"PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-dir3/blob/main/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Lightweight dual-panel file explorer that looks identical on Windows, macOS and Linux","license":"PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-dir3/blob/main/LICENSE.md","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"A lightweight dual-panel file explorer that looks and behaves the same on\nWindows, macOS and Linux. It is a single statically linked executable written\nentirely in Rust and draws its own UI - no Qt, WebView or Electron.\n\nFeatures: tabs, inline tree, preview pane (text, images, archive listings,\nWASM plugins), built-in terminal, batch rename, checksums, duplicate finder,\nfolder compare and sync, fast copy (CopyFileEx with parallel small files),\nfavorites, trash with restore. Settings live in %APPDATA%\\nexa-dir, or next to\nthe executable in a data folder for portable use.\n\nLicense: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 - free for noncommercial use only;\ncommercial use requires a license.","moniker":"nexa-dir","name":"Nexa Dir","packageUrl":"https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-dir3","publisher":"SosomLab","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/SosomLab","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/SosomLab/nexa-dir3/releases/tag/v0.29.0","tags":["file-manager","file-explorer","dual-panel","cross-platform","rust"]}},"longDescription":"A lightweight dual-panel file explorer that looks and behaves the same on\nWindows, macOS and Linux. It is a single statically linked executable written\nentirely in Rust and draws its own UI - no Qt, WebView or Electron.\n\nFeatures: tabs, inline tree, preview pane (text, images, archive listings,\nWASM plugins), built-in ter